[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0643","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0643.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57926","title":"Linux Kernel MediaTek DRM 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MediaTek DRM 子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。在 mtk_drm_bind 函数中，当 mtk_drm_kms_init 初始化失败时，drm 对象会通过 drm_dev_put 被释放，但 private->all_drm_private[i]->drm 指针未被置为 NULL。系统关机时调用 drm_atomic_helper_shutdown 会访问该悬空指针，导致释放后使用。本地攻击者可通过构造特定条件触发该漏洞，造成系统崩溃或潜在的信息泄露与权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 MediaTek DRM 驱动，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57926"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至包含提交 fa1a78e5d24b 的版本（如 v6.13-rc2 及以上），该提交修复了 mtk_drm_bind 失败时未将指针置 NULL 导致的 use-after-free 问题。Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7514-1 安全更新，通过 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-* 完成升级。如无法立即更新，可临时限制 Mediatek DRM 模块加载（通过 blacklist mtk_drm），但建议尽快打补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/078b2ff7da200b7532398e668eef723ad40fb516","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36684e9d88a2e2401ae26715a2e217cb4295cea7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7083b93e9755d60f0c2bcaa9d064308108280534","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57926.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57926.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57926","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57926.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57926.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57926.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57926.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57926-drmmediatek-set-private-all-drm-pri-1771411985000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-58rp-5478-74m7/GHSA-58rp-5478-74m7.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57926"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0643.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0642","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0642.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57925","title":"Linux ksmbd 空指针解引用导致非法内存访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ksmbd（SMB/CIFS 文件服务器）实现中存在空指针解引用漏洞。在 smb2_send_interim_resp() 函数中，当 ksmbd_alloc_work_struct() 分配工作结构体失败时返回 NULL 指针，后续 allocate_interim_rsp_buf() 未做空值检查即直接访问 in_work->response_buf，导致非法内存写入。本地低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞触发内核崩溃或造成系统完整性及可用性受损。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 ksmbd 模块，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57925"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:14Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：稳定分支升级至 5.15.177、6.1.125、6.6.72 或 6.12.10 及以上版本，主线内核升级至 6.13 及以上版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 至 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1，Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级 linux-image-5.15.0-1077-intel-iotg 至 5.15.0-1077.83~20.04.1，Debian 用户参考 DLA-4041-1 公告更新。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 ksmbd 内核模块（rmmod ksmbd）或通过防火墙限制 SMB 端口（445/tcp）访问作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/271ae0edbfc942795c162e6cf20d2bc02bd7fde4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2976e91a3e569cf2c92c9f71512c0ab1312fe965","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c16e1cadcbcaf3c82d5fc310fbd34d0f5d0db7c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/781c743e18bfd9b7dc0383f036ae952bd1486f21","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee7e40f7fb17f08a8cbae50553e5c2e10ae32fce","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57925.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57925.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57925","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57925.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57925.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57925.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/066c76d152f5fd6bc8455ceb09c7d8c2c3b74da6/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57925-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-v3qj-q3px-pcxw/GHSA-v3qj-q3px-pcxw.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57925","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57925.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0642.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0641","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57924","title":"Linux Kernel 文件句柄编码失败断言错误拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核文件系统导出层（exportfs）在处理文件句柄编码失败时存在可触发的断言（WARN_ON）漏洞。当文件系统的 `->encode_fh()` 方法因各种原因（如缓存回收、overlayfs 配置等）返回失败时，内核会错误地触发 WARN_ON 断言，导致内核崩溃或系统拒绝服务。本地低权限攻击者可通过结合 overlayfs（挂载 index=on,nfs_export=on 选项）、inotify 和 drop_caches 等操作触发该断言，造成系统可用性受损。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 v6.6 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已通过移除错误的 WARN_ON 断言来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57924"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:26Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:14Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.151、6.6.74、6.12.10 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 974e3fe0ac61、adcde2872f8f、f47c834a9131、73697928c806。如无法立即升级，可临时限制本地用户对 overlayfs（挂载 index=on,nfs_export=on）和 inotify 的访问权限以降低触发风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/73697928c806fe4689939722184a86fc1c1957b4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/974e3fe0ac61de85015bbe5a4990cf4127b304b2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/adcde2872f8fc399b249758ae1990dcd53b694ea","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f47c834a9131ae64bee3c462f4e610c67b0a000f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-032379.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57924.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57924.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57924.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57924","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57924.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57924.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/066c76d152f5fd6bc8455ceb09c7d8c2c3b74da6/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57924-2025-11-03-1121","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57924.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57924.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f344-cfpj-cvmx/GHSA-f344-cfpj-cvmx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0641.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0640","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57922","title":"Linux AMD Display 驱动除零错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/AMD Display 驱动中的 dml ceil/floor 辅助函数（dcn_bw_ceil2 和 dcn_bw_floor2）缺少对 granularity 参数的零值检查，当传入零值时触发除零错误，导致内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统可用性受影响。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。修复补丁已合入主线内核，需更新至包含该修复的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57922"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:14Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 f6e09701c3eb2ccb8cb0518e0b67f1c69742a4ec 的版本（主线内核 ≥ 6.13，或各发行版已合入该补丁的内核包）。Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-1077-intel-iotg 及以上版本；Debian 11 用户应用 DLA-4075-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用受影响 AMD GPU 的显示模式库（DML）相关功能模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0881fbc4fd62e00a2b8e102725f76d10351b2ea8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/497471baf53bb8fd3cd1529d65d4d7f7b81f1917","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f0dd09ed3001725ffd8cdc2868e71df585392fe","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8a9315e6f7b2d94c65a1ba476481deddb20fc3ae","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95793f9684e58d2aa56671b2d616b4f9f577a0a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae9ab63a268be99a27a4720ca24f6be801744fee","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f3d1e4062ef251fa55ccfeca1e54a98b6818b3a1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57922.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57922.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57922.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57922","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57922.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57922.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/066c76d152f5fd6bc8455ceb09c7d8c2c3b74da6/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57922-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57922.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-94vx-hxvv-26m7/GHSA-94vx-hxvv-26m7.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57922"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0634","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0634.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57913","title":"Linux 内核 USB Gadget FunctionFS 竞态条件导致内核恐慌漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB gadget 子系统的 FunctionFS（f_fs）驱动中存在条件竞争漏洞。当系统启用 `panic_on_warn` 参数时，`functionfs_bind` 函数中不必要的 `WARN_ON` 调用会触发内核恐慌（kernel panic），导致系统重启或不可用。该漏洞影响运行 Linux 内核且使用 USB gadget 功能的设备，CVSS 评分为 4.7（中危）。攻击者需在本地具有一定权限并能够触发 ADB 功能路径与 UDC 写操作的竞争场景才能利用此漏洞。攻击利用会导致系统服务中断（可用性影响），但无法获取敏感数据或提升权限。上游社区已通过移除 `functionfs_bind` 中的 `WARN_ON` 调用来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57913"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 >=5.15.0 或 >=6.1.0（具体取决于发行版的补丁策略），并重启系统。Debian 12 (bookworm) 应升级到 学士计划中的补丁版本；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 应应用 USN-7381-1 安全更新；所有 RHEL/CentOS/Fedora 系统应更新到官方提供的内核补丁。升级后验证内核版本包含对 CVE-2024-57913 的修复（检查补丁日志中的 \"usb: gadget: f_fs: Remove WARN_ON in functionfs_bind\"）。如无法立即升级，可通过 `/proc/sys/kernel/panic_on_oops` 设置为 0 临时禁用 panic_on_warn 以减少风险。重启后检查 functionfs 驱动状态，确保 none 警告已被移除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/19fc1c83454ca9d5699e39633ec79ce26355251c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e4d32cc145955d5c56c5498a3ff057e4aafa9d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82f60f3600aecd9ffcd0fbc4e193694511c85b47","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8b6a18b9b66cc4c016d63132b59ce5383f7cdd2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bfe60030fcd976e3546e1f73d6d0eb3fea26442e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dfc51e48bca475bbee984e90f33fdc537ce09699","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ea6a1498742430eb2effce0d1439ff29ef37dd7d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57913.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57913.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57913","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57913.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dde61f61b53e6605a407232356bfa1ca7643b1ec/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57913.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57913.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57913.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57913-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-5m3g-gpvq-34jp/GHSA-5m3g-gpvq-34jp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57913"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0634.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0633","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0633.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57912","title":"Linux 内核 ZPA2326 压力传感器驱动 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 IIO 子系统中压力传感器驱动 zpa2326 的触发缓冲区实现存在信息泄漏漏洞。驱动使用的 'sample' 本地结构体在 temperature 字段（u16）与 timestamp 字段（u64）之间存在未初始化的内存空洞，当通过触发缓冲机制将数据推送至用户空间时，该空洞中的未初始化内核内存内容会被泄露给用户态进程。攻击者需具备本地访问权限且低权限即可利用，无需用户交互，可读取内核栈/堆内存中的敏感信息（如指针、密钥等），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.1（HIGH，AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H）。影响使用 zpa2326 压力传感器驱动的 Linux 内核版本，修复方案是在使用前将结构体零初始化以避免信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57912"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Debian 11 (bullseye) 请升级 linux-6.1 至 6.1.6.1.128-1~deb11u1 或更高版本（`apt update && apt install linux-image-6.1.0-32-amd64`）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 请应用 USN-7381-1 提供的内核更新（`apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic`）；通用内核请升级至 5.4.290、5.10.234、5.15.177、6.1.125、6.6.72、6.12.10 或 6.13 及以上版本。若无法立即升级内核，可临时卸载 zpa2326 压力传感器驱动作为缓解措施：`modprobe -r zpa2326` 并将其加入 `/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-zpa2326.conf`（`echo \"blacklist zpa2326\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-zpa2326.conf`），重启后生效；同时限制非受信本地用户访问 IIO 子系统设备节点（`/dev/iio:device*`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6007d10c5262f6f71479627c1216899ea7f09073","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64a989aa7475b8e76e69b9ec86819ea293e53bab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9629ff1a86823269b12fb1ba9ca4efa945906287","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/979a0db76ceda8fe1f2f85a116bfe97620ebbadf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b7849f62e61242e0e02c776e1109eb81e59c567c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d25f1fc273670271412a52a1efbdaf5dcf274ed8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fefb88a4da961a0b9c2473cbdcfce1a942fcfa9a","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57912.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57912.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57912.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57912","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dde61f61b53e6605a407232356bfa1ca7643b1ec/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57912.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57912.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57912-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57912.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-37pg-r5mj-5q6w/GHSA-37pg-r5mj-5q6w.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57912"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0633.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0632","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0632.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57911","title":"Linux Kernel IIO 子系统 信息泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Linux 核心 IIO 虚拟设备驱动程序 iio_simply_dummy_buffer 的触发缓冲区处理过程中。 由于使用 iio_for_each_active_channel 仅遍历活动通道，导致分配的 data 数组无法清空不活跃通道的数据。 这样的缺陷导致在向用户空间推送数据时，反复出现初始化不完整，从而形成信息泄漏。 攻击者仅需要低权限本地访问权限即可触发该漏洞，成功会导致严重的信息泄漏和可用性破坏。 通过修改内核代码，将 kmalloc 替换为 kzalloc，确保内存区域初始化完毕，此类方法可有效解决上述问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57911"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:12Z","remediation":"升级内核到 ≥6.8 版本（含 CVE-2024-57911 修复），或针对 Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get install linux-image-$(uname -r | grep -E '^[0-9]+' | cut -d'.' -f1).$(uname -r | awk -F'-' '{print $1}' | cut -d'.' -f2) && reboot`。对于 RHEL/CentOS 使用 `yum update kernel` 或 `dnf install kernel`. 停用所有 iio 虚拟设备模块并避免使用 iio_simply_dummy_buffer 驱动程序，降低信息泄露风险。系统管理员应立即验证内核版本，确保基础补丁已安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/006073761888a632c5d6f93e47c41760fa627f77","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03fa47621bf8fcbf5994c5716021527853f9af3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/333be433ee908a53f283beb95585dfc14c8ffb46","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/74058395b2c63c8a438cf199d09094b640f8c7f4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0642d9c871aea1f28eb02cd84d60434df594f67","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e1c1e8c05010103c9c9ea3e9c4304b0b7e2c8e4a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ea703cda36da0dacb9a2fd876370003197d8a019","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57911.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57911.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57911.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57911","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dde61f61b53e6605a407232356bfa1ca7643b1ec/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57911.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57911.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57911-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57911.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57911-iio-dummy-iio-simply-dummy-buffer-f-1771412482000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-2w6v-cv9c-qwv2/GHSA-2w6v-cv9c-qwv2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0632.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0631","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0631.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57910","title":"Linux内核 vcnl4035光传感器驱动 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 vcnl4035 光传感器驱动（IIO 子系统）的触发缓冲区实现存在未初始化内存泄漏漏洞。驱动在向用户空间推送触发缓冲区数据时，使用的局部数组未对单个数据元素（u16 对齐至 8 字节）进行初始化，导致至少 4 字节未初始化内核内存被泄露至用户空间。本地攻击者只需低权限即可触发缓冲区读取，无需用户交互，可获取内核栈/堆敏感信息（机密性影响高），且可能引发拒绝服务（可用性影响高）。影响使用 vcnl4035 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.1（HIGH），攻击向量本地、攻击复杂度低、权限要求低。Linux 内核已通过将缓冲区数组初始化为零修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57910"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic (USN-7381-1)；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-127-generic (USN-7459-1)；Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-5.10.223-1 (DLA-4075-1)。上游内核已在 v6.12-rc1 合并修复提交 8f8a6b8c8f3a (iio: light: vcnl4035: fix information leak in triggered buffer)。若无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 vcnl4035 驱动缓解：echo \"blacklist vcnl4035\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-vcnl4035.conf 并重启或执行 modprobe -r vcnl4035 卸载模块（需确认设备不依赖该光线传感器）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/13e56229fc81051a42731046e200493c4a7c28ff","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47b43e53c0a0edf5578d5d12f5fc71c019649279","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47d245be86492974db3aeb048609542167f56518","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a15ea87d4337479c9446b5d71616f4668337afed","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0e9c11c762e4286732d80e66c08c2cb3157b06b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb488706cdec0d6d13f2895bcdf0c32b283a7cc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6fb1c59776b4263634c472a5be8204c906ffc2c","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57910.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57910.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57910.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57910","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57910.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57910.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57910.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57910-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-rwgg-m734-wvjr/GHSA-rwgg-m734-wvjr.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57910"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0631.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0630","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0630.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57908","title":"Linux Kernel KMX61 IMU 驱动 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 IIO 子系统中的 Kionix KMX61 IMU 驱动触发缓冲区存在信息泄漏漏洞。漏洞原理是驱动使用的本地 buffer 数组在向用户空间推送触发缓冲区数据时，仅通过 iio_for_each_active_channel() 为活跃通道赋值，未初始化非活跃通道的数组元素，导致未初始化的内核栈内存被泄露至用户空间。影响范围为启用了 CONFIG_IIO_STM_SENSORS_KMX61 配置的 Linux 内核版本。攻击条件为本地攻击者拥有低权限访问权限，无需用户交互，可通过触发缓冲区读取操作获取内核内存敏感信息，导致高机密性影响和高可用性影响，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.1（HIGH）。修复方式为在使用 buffer 数组前将其初始化为零。Linux 内核已在相关版本中通过提交修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57908"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.10 或更高版本（包含修复补丁 0495104b0f2f36cb7a3413ea0cf997a2ae2a70e9）。Ubuntu/Debian 执行：apt-get update && apt-get install linux-image-6.12.10；CentOS/RHEL 执行：yum update kernel；Fedora 执行：dnf update kernel。如无法立即升级内核，可临时禁用 KMX61 驱动：echo \"blacklist kmx61\" > /etc/modprobe.d/kmx61.conf 并重启，或在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_IIO_STM_SENSORS_KMX61 后重新编译内核。该漏洞影响内核 4.0 至 6.12.9 版本，本地低权限攻击者可读取内核栈内存，建议尽快应用厂商安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0871eb8d700b33dd7fa86c80630d62ddaef58c2c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/565814cbbaa674d2901428796801de49a611e59d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6985ba4467e4b15b809043fa7740d1fb23a1897b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ae053113f6a226a2303caa4936a4c37f3bfff7b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a07f698084412a3ef5e950fcac1d6b0f53289efd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a386d9d2dc6635f2ec210b8199cfb3acf4d31305","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cde312e257b59ecaa0fad3af9ec7e2370bb24639","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57908.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57908.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57908.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57908","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57908.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57908.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57908-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57908.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f5j6-wv5v-rgw9/GHSA-f5j6-wv5v-rgw9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57908"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0630.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0629","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57907","title":"Rockchip SARADC 驱动触发缓冲区信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Rockchip SARADC 驱动的触发缓冲区实现中存在信息泄漏漏洞。由于触发缓冲区中的 'data' 本地结构体在向用户空间推送数据时，仅通过 iio_for_each_active_channel() 为活跃通道赋值，未对非活跃通道进行初始化，导致未初始化的内核栈内存内容被泄露至用户空间。该漏洞影响搭载 Rockchip SoC 并使用 rockchip_saradc 驱动的 Linux 设备（如 Rockchip 平台的开发板、嵌入式设备等）。攻击条件为本地访问权限、低攻击复杂度、低权限且无需用户交互 (CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H，CVSS 7.1 HIGH)。本地攻击者可通过触发 ADC 触发缓冲区读取操作，获取内核未初始化的栈内存数据，导致高机密性影响（信息泄漏）和高可用性影响（可能导致系统崩溃）。Linux 内核已通过在使用前将结构体初始化为零来修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57907"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核到已修复版本：Linux 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.73、6.1.123、5.15.176、5.10.235、5.4.289 或更高版本。Debian 11 请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新（linux 5.10.235-1），Ubuntu 24.04 请安装 USN-7381-1（linux 6.8.0-52.52），Ubuntu 20.04 请安装 USN-7459-1（linux 5.15.0-130.139），RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 请关注 RHSA-2025 相关公告并升级内核。如无法立即重启内核，可临时禁用 rockchip_saradc 驱动（`modprobe -r rockchip_saradc` 或在内核命令行添加 `module_blacklist=rockchip_saradc`）作为缓解措施，但会导致 Rockchip ADC 功能不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38724591364e1e3b278b4053f102b49ea06ee17c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a95fbbecec7a34bbad5dcc3156700b8711d53c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64b79afdca7b27a768c7d3716b7f4deb1d6b955c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a07fb80ea886e9134284a27d0155cca7649e293","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8193941bc4fe7247ff13233f328aea709f574554","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/85a9c98a5e0f22d911b00077d751e34fff1401aa","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57907.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57907.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57907","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57907-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57907.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6hmf-56g8-p898/GHSA-6hmf-56g8-p898.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57907"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0628","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57906","title":"Linux 开源项目 IIO ADC 驱动程序 ti-ads8688 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核工业 I/O (IIO) 子系统中 TI ADS8688 ADC 驱动的触发缓冲区实现存在信息泄漏漏洞。驱动在触发缓冲区模式下使用局部数组 buffer 向用户空间推送采样数据，但仅通过 iio_for_each_active_channel() 为活跃通道赋值，未初始化非活跃通道对应的数组元素。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过触发 ADC 缓冲区读取操作，可读取内核栈上未初始化的内存残留数据（如指针、栈帧数据等），导致高机密性影响（内核内存泄露）和高可用性影响（可能引发内核崩溃）。影响搭载 TI ADS8688 ADC 芯片并启用 IIO 触发缓冲区功能的 Linux 内核版本（含主线内核及各发行版下游内核），攻击者需本地访问权限且能访问 IIO 设备节点，通过读取触发缓冲区数据即可触发信息泄露。Linux 内核已通过在推送数据前将 buffer 数组零初始化的方式修复该漏洞（CVE-2024-57906，CVSS 7.1 HIGH，CWE-908）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57906"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到包含补丁 commit 1c80a0985a9a14f33dbf63cd703ca010f094f878 或更高版本（如 v6.6.72+、v6.12.10+、v6.13-rc6+），对 drivers/iio/adc/ti-ads8688.c 文件进行 patch 应用，确保 buffer 数组被初始化为零，防止非活跃通道的未初始化数据泄露给用户空间。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1c80a0985a9a14f33dbf63cd703ca010f094f878","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a7377ccfd940cd6e9201756aff1e7852c266e69","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3bf8d1e87939b8a19c9b738564fddf5b73322f2f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/455df95eb8f24a37abc549d6738fc8ee07eb623b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/485570ed82b7a6bb109fa1d0a79998e21f7f4c73","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aae96738006840533cf147ffd5f41830987f21c5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ebe2672bc42a0dfe31bb539f8ce79d024aa7e46d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57906.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57906.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57906","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57906.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57906-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f5w3-q6fx-5p9r/GHSA-f5w3-q6fx-5p9r.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57906"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0639","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0639.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57916","title":"Linux Microchip PCI1xxxx GPIO 中断处理内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Microchip PCI1xxxx 系列芯片的 GPIO 驱动程序中存在 IRQ 处理缺陷，当本地攻击者在访问 GPIO 寄存器值的同时触发 GPIO 中断时，驱动程序使用 generic_handle_irq 函数处理嵌套中断，导致中断上下文混乱，进而引发内核崩溃（kernel panic）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.1 至 6.13-rc6 版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问能力，通过精心构造的 GPIO 中断触发条件即可造成系统拒绝服务。Linux 内核社区已通过将 generic_handle_irq 替换为 handle_nested_irq 修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57916"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.125、6.6.72 或 6.12.10 及以上版本，对应补丁已合入主线。Debian 12 用户应用 DSA-5860 安全更新（`apt update && apt upgrade`），Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新后重启。如无法立即升级，可在 BIOS 中禁用板载 Microchip PCI1xxxx 控制器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57916.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57916.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57916","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/066c76d152f5fd6bc8455ceb09c7d8c2c3b74da6/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57916-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57916.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-hgm9-g82q-236j/GHSA-hgm9-g82q-236j.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57916"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0639.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0546","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52005","title":"Git Git 边带信道ANSI转义序列注入漏洞","description":"Git 源代码管理工具在通过 sideband 通道传输远程 Git 进程的提示或错误消息时，未对消息内容进行过滤处理，直接将其传递到终端标准错误输出。由于现代终端支持 ANSI 转义序列，恶意攻击者可在克隆、拉取或推送操作中注入特制的 ANSI 转义序列，从而隐藏或篡改显示信息，诱导用户执行非受信脚本。该漏洞影响所有使用 Git 与不受信源进行交互的场景，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户尽快升级至修复版本，无法升级时应避免从非受信源执行递归克隆操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52005"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T18:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:06:47Z","remediation":"升级 Git 至包含补丁的版本（Git for Windows v2.47.1(2) 已修复此问题，上游 Linux/macOS 版本补丁正在邮件列表讨论中，请关注 Git 官方发布）。在补丁可用前，避免执行 `git clone --recursive` 从不可信源克隆仓库，并避免在终端中直接查看来自不可信远程仓库的 stderr 输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/git/git/security/advisories/GHSA-7jjc-gg6m-3329","https://lore.kernel.org/git/1M9FnZ-1taoNo1wwh-00ESSd@mail.gmx.net","https://github.com/andrewd-cg/cve-2024-52005-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52005.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2024/CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/178bcb396ea0966e2a6aefa308b23c11593087fc/data/2024/CVE-2024-52005-andrewd-cg_cve-2024-52005-poc.md","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/52e6c365c84db8afe29c8cad291c135c0605264c/specs/g/git/git.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52005","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-52005.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52005.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0473","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12084","title":"Rsync Rsync 守护进程 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是一个由 Rync 协议栈中的整数溢出漏洞导致的堆缓冲区溢出问题。该漏洞源于对攻击者控制的校验和长度（s2length）处理不当，当 MAX_DIGEST_LEN 超过固定的 SUM_LENGTH（16 字节）时，攻击者可以向 sum2 缓冲区写入超出边界的数据。在未身份验证的远程攻击者通过向目标系统发送特制的 IPv6 数据包触发此漏洞后，可导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在 2024 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12084"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T15:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:29Z","remediation":"立即将 rsync 升级至 3.4.0 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Debian/Ubuntu 运行 apt update && apt upgrade rsync，Red Hat 系列安装 RHBA-2025:6470 更新（rsync-3.4.1-2.el10），源码编译用户从 https://rsync.samba.org 下载 3.4.0 重新编译。如无法立即升级，在非必要服务器上停止 rsync --daemon 服务（systemctl stop rsync && systemctl disable rsync），并在防火墙限制 rsync 端口（默认 873）仅允许可信来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12084","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2330527","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/14/6","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/google/security-research/security/advisories/GHSA-p5pg-x43v-mvqj","https://github.com/InkeyP/CVE-2024-12084","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2024/CVE-2024-12084.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2025-02/%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%20Rsync%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ce14b54e9cc4d6f7db4ad24bbd8c2864f1be855b/data/2024/CVE-2024-12084-InkeyP_CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2024/CVE-2024-12084.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-12084/README.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12084.json","https://github.com/Xe/site/blob/0c8b20018848d417298aa7212d9a06fac114a0bc/lume/src/shitposts/no-way-to-prevent-this/CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2024-12084-2025-01-14-2205","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/themirze/cve-2024-12084","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2024-12084"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0473.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0627","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0627.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57902","title":"Linux 基金会 内核 af_packet 模块 VLAN TCI MSG_PEEK 处理缺陷","description":"Linux内核的af_packet协议栈存在链路层数据包处理漏洞。由于vlan_get_tci()函数在处理MSG_PEEK标志位时验证不足，导致函数试图读取和修改内核中共享的socket缓冲区(skb)的数据，但同时没有正确处理多CPU并发访问的情况。攻击者可以向目标系统发送特定的IPv6数据包，触发函数对不受保护的skb成员进行读写操作，从而破坏内核内存一致性，诱发系统崩溃并产生核心转储。受影响的Linux内核版本主要包括Ubuntu 24.04 LTS、Ubuntu 20.04 LTS、Debian 11等系统网络子模块，攻击者通过本地socket接口发送恶意数据包即可触发漏洞，对系统稳定性造成严重影响。该漏洞通过修正vlan_get_tci()函数以完全避免直接操作skb、添加常量修饰符以及完善标志位检查来修复，目前厂商已发布安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57902"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13.0 或更高版本（已修复 af_packet vlan_get_tci() MSG_PEEK 崩溃问题）。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新（内核 5.10.223-1 及以上）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7459-1 更新（linux-image-5.15.0-127-generic 及以上）。RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 用户请通过 dnf/yum 更新至内核 5.14.0-503.11.1.el9_5 或更高版本。若无法立即重启内核，可暂时禁用 af_packet 模块（modprobe -r af_packet 并加入 modprobe.blacklist=af_packet 内核参数）作为临时缓解，但会导致抓包工具（如 tcpdump、Wireshark）失效，建议尽快安装内核更新并重启。请通过发行版官方仓库（apt/dnf/yum/zypper）安装更新，避免使用非官方内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65c67049e9ed481f6b52264b39618b8c6dfb1d3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/66ffb0cf2125dcf9e902eede4a43653a24fd9cb2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/77ee7a6d16b6ec07b5c3ae2b6b60a24c1afbed09","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7aa78d0d8546d8ce5a764add3f55d72e707c18f1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b65292a548d847099a4fe0fff53122a06e798e25","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d91b4a9baa018a001d5c884e236c0